{"seq":1,"slug":"peak-valley-crowd-supplement","title":"峰谷弹性运力补充","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdsourced-elastic-lastmile/elastic-capacity-schedule/peak-valley-crowd-supplement","wordCount":1952,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"峰谷弹性运力补充\">峰谷弹性运力补充</h1><p>中午十二点四十分，写字楼片区的订单量是三十分钟前的四倍，而在线的骑手只多了一个——因为另一个正好下线吃饭。这个时间差是弹性调度的全部难点：<strong>需求可以在一刻钟内翻倍，供给的反应时间以小时计</strong>。众包网络的优势不是&quot;随时有人&quot;，而是&quot;只要激励到位，可以随时把原本不在线的人叫出来&quot;；但这个&quot;叫&quot;必须提前做出，否则激励发出去时订单已经在超时。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-可调度运力的池子分层\">核心概念：可调度运力的池子分层</h2><p>要预测缺口，先要定义&quot;供给&quot;是什么。众包网络的运力不是一个数，而是按上线意愿分层的几个池子。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三层运力池\">三层运力池</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>池子</th>\n<th>状态定义</th>\n<th>触发上线的条件</th>\n<th>响应时延</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>热池</td>\n<td>已在线、可接单</td>\n<td>无需触发</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>温池</td>\n<td>已登录 App、未上线</td>\n<td>看到溢价或激励</td>\n<td>5–30 分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷池</td>\n<td>已注册、当日未启动 App</td>\n<td>收到推送或短信激励</td>\n<td>1–4 小时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三个池子的人数差异通常是数量级的：热池可能与温池相当，而冷池是热池的十倍以上。这意味着<strong>弹性主要来自冷池与温池</strong>，但它们需要不同的触达手段和不同的提前量。溢价只能触达温池（冷池的人不在 App 里看不到），推送与短信才能触达冷池——这就是为什么 <a href=\"../real-time-dispatch-bid/dynamic-pricing-surge\">动态定价与高峰激励</a> 里强调激励需要提前发布。</p>\n<h3 id=\"缺口定义的三种口径\">缺口定义的三种口径</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[需求预测: 未来 T 分钟订单数 D] --&gt; C[缺口 G = D - S_eff]&#10;  B[供给: 热池 * 效率系数 + 温池 * 转化率估计] --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt;|G &lt;= 0| D[不发激励]&#10;  C --&gt;|G &gt; 0| E{缺口规模}&#10;  E --&gt;|小| F[仅提高溢价倍数]&#10;  E --&gt;|中| G1[溢价 + 温池激励推送]&#10;  E --&gt;|大| H[溢价 + 温池 + 冷池短信召回]&#10;  G1 --&gt; I[观测实际上线人数]&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  F --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[与预测比对&lt;br/&gt;修正转化率参数]&#10;  J --&gt; A\">graph TD\n  A[需求预测: 未来 T 分钟订单数 D] --&gt; C[缺口 G = D - S_eff]\n  B[供给: 热池 * 效率系数 + 温池 * 转化率估计] --&gt; C\n  C --&gt;|G &lt;= 0| D[不发激励]\n  C --&gt;|G &gt; 0| E{缺口规模}\n  E --&gt;|小| F[仅提高溢价倍数]\n  E --&gt;|中| G1[溢价 + 温池激励推送]\n  E --&gt;|大| H[溢价 + 温池 + 冷池短信召回]\n  G1 --&gt; I[观测实际上线人数]\n  H --&gt; I\n  F --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[与预测比对&lt;br/&gt;修正转化率参数]\n  J --&gt; A</pre><p>这个闭环的关键反馈是 <code>J</code> 步：每次激励活动的&quot;发出量 → 实际上线量&quot;之比，就是转化率的观测值。用这个观测值滚动修正下一轮的估计，是让这套系统从&quot;拍脑袋&quot;变成&quot;可运营&quot;的分水岭。</p>\n<h2 id=\"需求预测-短周期与形态特征\">需求预测：短周期与形态特征</h2><h3 id=\"为什么不能用简单移动平均\">为什么不能用简单移动平均</h3><p>配送需求的形态由三个成分叠加：<strong>趋势</strong>（商圈人流变化）、<strong>周期</strong>（工作日/周末、早中晚餐点）、<strong>天气与事件</strong>（暴雨、演唱会、补贴活动）。直接对原始序列做移动平均会把周期成分抹平，导致每天中午都预测偏低。</p>\n<p>工程上可用的最小方案是把三者分解后分别预测再相加：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>D</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{D}_t = \\mu_{base}(cell, dow, hour) \\cdot \\gamma_{weather}(t, cell) \\cdot (1 + \\epsilon_{event})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_{base}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是&quot;某格子、某星期几、某小时&quot;的历史中位数（比均值鲁棒），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma_{weather}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是天气修正因子（按格子标定，雨天通常显著大于 1），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon_{event}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是事件修正（本地活动、平台补贴）。这个分解的好处是每个成分都可以独立观测与校正，运营能理解预测为什么变。</p>\n<p>预测之外还有一层更根本的手段：<strong>用价格与选项设计主动塑造需求形状</strong>，让需求向低成本时段与低成本履约方式迁移。一项针对混合尾程（上门时段 + 自提柜选项）的研究把这类顺序决策建模为有限期马尔可夫决策过程，用近似动态规划学习延续价值、估计各选项的机会成本，并在真实城市实例上报告了平均单期利润相对现行做法约 7.0% 的提升（95% 置信区间 6.7–7.2%），提升主要来自履约成本下降；研究还发现动态定价在菜单中包含&quot;运营上有用的柜机选项&quot;时才最有效（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.13539\">Assortment Control Unlocks the Value of Dynamic Pricing in Mixed Last-Mile Delivery</a>）。这条结论对峰谷调度的直接含义是：<strong>预测缺口之后不要只想着补运力，先看能不能把需求挪走</strong>——把一部分上门单引导到自提柜，缺口可能直接消失。</p>\n<h3 id=\"预测尺度与提前量\">预测尺度与提前量</h3><p>预测窗口与可用的干预手段必须匹配：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>预测窗口</th>\n<th>可用的干预</th>\n<th>干预有效性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0–15 分钟</td>\n<td>提高溢价、扩大派单圈层</td>\n<td>只影响热池与温池边缘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>15–60 分钟</td>\n<td>温池激励推送</td>\n<td>中等，取决于推送到达率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1–4 小时</td>\n<td>冷池短信召回 + 预约排班</td>\n<td>高，但需要模型准确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 天以上</td>\n<td>排班计划与激励预算分配</td>\n<td>最高，用于大促与节假日</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的读法是：<strong>不同时间尺度的问题要用不同的工具，且必须用当期可用的工具</strong>。用 1 小时才生效的短信召回去处理 15 分钟内出现的缺口是无效的——那个缺口只能靠溢价或扩圈硬扛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预约排班与实时激励的成本权衡\">预约排班与实时激励的成本权衡</h2><h3 id=\"两种补充手段的成本结构\">两种补充手段的成本结构</h3><p><strong>预约排班</strong>是提前锁定：司机承诺某时段在线，平台承诺最低收入（保底）。它的成本是确定的（保底支出），收益是确定的（锁定运力）。</p>\n<p><strong>实时激励</strong>是即时竞价：不承诺收入，按实际上线情况付费。它的成本是不确定的（可能发了很多钱但没人来），收益也是不确定的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE capacity_plan (&#10;  plan_id        BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  market         TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  zone_id        BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  slot_start     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  slot_end       TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  predicted_demand   INTEGER NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_supply   INTEGER NOT NULL,&#10;  gap                INTEGER NOT NULL,&#10;  lever              TEXT NOT NULL,     -- surge|warm_push|cold_sms|booking&#10;  budget_cents       BIGINT,&#10;  actual_demand      INTEGER,            -- 事后回填&#10;  actual_supply      INTEGER,&#10;  actual_cost_cents  BIGINT,&#10;  created_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_capacity_plan_slot ON capacity_plan (zone_id, slot_start);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> capacity_plan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plan_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  zone_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  slot_start     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  slot_end       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  predicted_demand   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_supply   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  gap                </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lever              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- surge|warm_push|cold_sms|booking</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  budget_cents       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  actual_demand      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 事后回填</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  actual_supply      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  actual_cost_cents  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_capacity_plan_slot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> capacity_plan (zone_id, slot_start);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>predicted_demand</code> 与 <code>actual_demand</code> 成对存储，是这套表最重要的设计——<strong>没有事后回填，参数就永远校准不了</strong>。<code>lever</code> 字段记录当次选择的手段，让不同手段的成本效益可以被横向比较。</p>\n<h3 id=\"保底承诺的定价\">保底承诺的定价</h3><p>预约排班的保底额需要满足两个条件：对司机有吸引力（高于他在其他平台同期的期望收入），对平台可承受（低于该时段缺口的损失）。一个可用的近似是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>e</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>β</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B = \\max\\left(\\bar{e}_{hour} \\cdot h \\cdot \\beta,\\ e_{min}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>e</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{e}_{hour}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7178em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该司机近 30 天的平均时薪，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 是承诺时长，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 是吸引力系数（通常 1.1–1.3）。用历史时薪做基准而不是统一价，避免高产能司机觉得保底太低而低产能司机来薅保底。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缺口与第二章的联动\">缺口与第二章的联动</h2><p>缺口信号不是只服务于激励，它同时驱动派单侧的参数调整：缺口大时，<a href=\"../real-time-dispatch-bid/order-dispatch-grab-match\">派单/抢单实时匹配</a> 的扩圈应该更早、更激进（因为等不到人），<a href=\"../real-time-dispatch-bid/along-route-batching\">顺路派送与订单聚合</a> 的单趟单数上限也可以临时放宽（因为运力稀缺时要榨干每一趟的产出），<a href=\"../real-time-dispatch-bid/dynamic-pricing-surge\">动态定价与高峰激励</a> 的溢价系数则直接由缺口比驱动。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;supply_gap_policy&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;zone_id&quot;: 4211,&#10;    &quot;forecast_horizon_minutes&quot;: 45,&#10;    &quot;hot_pool_online&quot;: 62,&#10;    &quot;warm_pool_estimate&quot;: 140,&#10;    &quot;warm_conversion_prior&quot;: 0.18,&#10;    &quot;effective_supply&quot;: 87,&#10;    &quot;predicted_demand&quot;: 121,&#10;    &quot;gap&quot;: 34,&#10;    &quot;actions&quot;: [&#10;      { &quot;lever&quot;: &quot;surge&quot;, &quot;param&quot;: { &quot;kappa&quot;: 0.8 } },&#10;      { &quot;lever&quot;: &quot;warm_push&quot;, &quot;param&quot;: { &quot;offer_cents&quot;: 250, &quot;ttl_minutes&quot;: 30 } },&#10;      { &quot;lever&quot;: &quot;batching_relax&quot;, &quot;param&quot;: { &quot;max_orders_per_trip&quot;: 4 } }&#10;    ]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"supply_gap_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"zone_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4211</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"forecast_horizon_minutes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">45</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"hot_pool_online\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">62</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"warm_pool_estimate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">140</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"warm_conversion_prior\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"effective_supply\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">87</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"predicted_demand\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">121</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"gap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">34</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"actions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"lever\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"surge\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"param\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kappa\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"lever\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"warm_push\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"param\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"offer_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">250</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ttl_minutes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"lever\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"batching_relax\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"param\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max_orders_per_trip\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个结构把&quot;缺口&quot;翻译成了三组可执行动作，而不是一个笼统的&quot;运力不足&quot;告警。<code>warm_conversion_prior</code> 正是前文说的可校准参数：每次 <code>warm_push</code> 之后用它预测的上线人数与实际比对，用观测比值更新它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>众包运力分三层池子（热池在线、温池登录未上线、冷池当日未启动），响应时延从 0 到数小时不等，弹性主要来自温池与冷池。</li>\n<li>激励的提前量必须匹配干预手段的生效时间：15 分钟内只能靠溢价与扩圈，1 小时以上才能用推送与短信召回，不同尺度的问题要用当期可用的工具。</li>\n<li>需求预测用&quot;基准中位数 × 天气因子 × 事件因子&quot;的分解式，比直接移动平均更鲁棒，且每个成分可独立校正。</li>\n<li>容量计划表必须成对存储预测值与实际值；没有事后回填，转化率参数永远校准不了。</li>\n<li>预约排班的保底额以司机历史时薪为基准（系数 1.1–1.3），避免统一价导致的逆向选择。</li>\n<li>缺口信号应同时驱动三个下游杠杆：溢价系数、激励投放、以及聚合的单趟单数上限放宽。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"峰谷弹性运力补充","id":"峰谷弹性运力补充"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：可调度运力的池子分层","id":"核心概念-可调度运力的池子分层"},{"level":3,"text":"三层运力池","id":"三层运力池"},{"level":3,"text":"缺口定义的三种口径","id":"缺口定义的三种口径"},{"level":2,"text":"需求预测：短周期与形态特征","id":"需求预测-短周期与形态特征"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么不能用简单移动平均","id":"为什么不能用简单移动平均"},{"level":3,"text":"预测尺度与提前量","id":"预测尺度与提前量"},{"level":2,"text":"预约排班与实时激励的成本权衡","id":"预约排班与实时激励的成本权衡"},{"level":3,"text":"两种补充手段的成本结构","id":"两种补充手段的成本结构"},{"level":3,"text":"保底承诺的定价","id":"保底承诺的定价"},{"level":2,"text":"缺口与第二章的联动","id":"缺口与第二章的联动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"动态定价与高峰激励","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdsourced-elastic-lastmile/real-time-dispatch-bid/dynamic-pricing-surge"},"next":{"title":"司机 App 轨迹与 ETA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdsourced-elastic-lastmile/elastic-capacity-schedule/courier-app-tracking-eta"}}